{{!
    @template local_lticompletionsync/level

    Declared capability level of a connection (cooperative, tool-only, no partner plugin, ...).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * ok - bool, the full cooperative level (or an enabled receiver) is available
    * label - string, short name of the level
    * description - string, what the level guarantees and what it does not

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ok": false,
        "label": "No partner plugin",
        "description": "The platform has no completion endpoint. Nothing is transferred."
    }
}}
<div class="local-lticompletionsync-level">
    <span class="badge {{#ok}}bg-success text-white{{/ok}}{{^ok}}bg-warning text-dark{{/ok}}">{{label}}</span>
    <div class="small text-muted">{{description}}</div>
</div>
